      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A significant occurrence of abnormal rhythm was observed in perfused working hearts of diabetic rats. The incidence of arrhythmias was 19/51 in diabetics as compared with 2/38 in normal controls. In considering possible pathogenetic mechanisms, conduction system defects appear to merit particular attention."},
